  "details": "This module allows you to configure your Drupal site as a SAML 2.0 Service Provider so that users can authenticate through an external identity provider.\n\nThe module does not sufficiently sanitize certain values derived from SAML assertions before displaying them to users. A malicious identity provider or an attacker able to supply crafted SAML attributes, leading to a cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability.",
